(6, 'Online Manual Transaction Records and Product Showcase for J&J Sportswear', 1, 5, '[\"Bautista\",\" Vacante\"]', '[\"asdasdasd\"]', '{\"abstract\":\"The study focuses on enhancing the operational efficiency of J&J Sportswear, a small tailoring business, by addressing challenges related to transaction tracking, employee management, and online visibility. \\r\\nThe proposed solutions include the development of a basic website, implementation of a transaction tracking system, and integration of employee management tools. This study aims to provide J&J Sportswear with digital solutions to streamline operations, improve customer engagement, and ultimately boost business growth.\\r\\nIn addition to benefiting J&J Sportswear, this research offers insights and practical recommendations that can serve as a blueprint for other small businesses facing similar challenges. By demonstrating the successful integration of digital tools in a small business context, this study contributes to the broader discourse on digital transformation in the SME sector. \\r\\nThrough a combination of interviews, pre-surveys, and technical analysis, this study underscores the potential of technology to revolutionize traditional business operations, ensuring sustainability and competitive advantage in an increasingly digital marketplace.\\r\\n\",\"publication_date\":\"2024-07-03\",\"keywords\":\"[\\\"asd\\\",\\\" asd\\\",\\\" asd\\\",\\\" asdasd asd\\\",\\\" asd\\\"]\"}', , 'Approved', '2024-08-30 07:47:27', '2024-09-01 11:12:21', 'Thesis');
